Arven Rauth.wikitext:
{{IronHandsPortal}}
{{otheruses|USE=Iron Hands Space Marine|OTHERUSE=Deathwatch Space Marine|OTHERPAGE=Darrion Rauth}}
'''Arven Rauth''' is a [[Space Marine Captain|Clan-Commander]] of the [[Iron Hands]], leader of [[Clan Raukaan]].{{Fn|1}} He took command of the Clan after [[Iron Father]] [[Kristos]] was [[Chaos|corrupted]] during the [[Gaudinian Heresy]].{{Fn|2}}

==Personality==
A cold, calculating leader, Arven Rauth has been purged of all weakness and in its place, only strength remains.{{Fn|1}}

==Physical appearance==
During his training as a [[Neophyte]], Rauth was severely wounded by a [[bolt]]-round fired by [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Tartrak]]. His left arm, heart and one lung blown were then eventually replaced by [[augmetic]]s.{{Fn|3a}} He was again severely wounded in battle against the so-called [[Prophet Alpha]].{{Fn|3b}} He later suffered further bodily damage battling [[Callivantine Cyber-ghoul]]s.{{Fn|4}}

