Arye Babbist.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
{{spoiler|source=The Guns of Tanith (Novel)}}
'''Arye Babbist''' was a [[Private|Private first class]] of the [[81st Phantine Skyborne]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]], who served under [[Lieutenant (Imperial Guard)|Lieutenant]] [[Goseph Kersherin]].{{Fn|1a}}

During the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]], Babbist was among those Phantine who took part in the liberation of [[Phantine (Planet)|their own homeworld]] from the forces of the [[Blood Pact]]. Just prior to the invasion of [[Ouranberg]], Kersherin, Babbist, [[Innis Unterrio|Unterrio]] and [[Lex Cardinale|Cardinale]] were selected to accompany sixteen Guardsmen of the [[Tanith First and Only]] regiment as part of [[Operation Larisel]].{{Fn|1a}} He was assigned as the Specialist for team Larisel 4, led by [[Imperial Guard Scout|Scout]]-[[Sergeant (Imperial Guard)|Sergeant]] [[Oan Mkoll|Mkoll]].{{Fn|1b}}{{Fn|1c}}

Unfortunately, during the approach to Ouranberg, Larisel 4's [[Marauder Bomber|Marauder]] was shot down by the city's air defences with all hands lost{{Fn|1b}}{{Fn|1c}} (save Mkoll, who managed to get to safety using his [[grav-chute]]).{{Fn|1d}}

