Arzach.wikitext:
{{AdeptusCustodesPortal}}
'''Arzach''' was a [[Prefect]]-[[Shield-Captain|Captain]] of the [[Adeptus Custodes]], who was among its forces that took part in the [[Siege of Terra]].{{Fn|1}}

Near the end of the Siege, he fought to defend the [[Imperial Palace]]'s [[Sanctum Imperialis]], but was among the Imperial forces left stranded after the closing of the [[Eternity Gate (Imperial)|Eternity Gate]]. Now having no means to escape or receive reinforcements, the remaining Imperials fought on against hordes of [[Traitor Legion]]s, [[Heretics]], [[Mutant]]s and [[Daemons]]. During these battles, Arzach and his [[Custodes]] [[Hetaeron Guard|Companion]]s killed Daemons that were feasting on the dead, within the Imperial Palace's '''Propinquity Court'''.{{Fn|1}}

