Asasmael.wikitext:
{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
'''Asasmael''' is a [[Blood Angels]] [[Codicier]], who is serving in the [[Chapter]]'s [[Diamor Campaign]] strike force.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
After the battle's end, however, members of the [[Chapter]]'s [[5th Company (Blood Angels)|5th Company]] were struck by a [[psychic]] attack, as their ships began to travel back to [[Baal]]. Nearly all would then unexpectedly fall to the [[Black Rage]], with only those who had protection or great will, managing to escape their [[Gene-seed]]'s curse. As they tried to deal with their fallen [[Battle Brothers]], the strike force also became aware of increasing psychic activity on the [[Diamor System]] world, [[Amethal]]. Asasmael later informed the [[Chapter]]'s command on Baal of this and of the 5th Company's fate. He would then ask for additional reinforcements to be sent, so that the strike force could investigate Amethal, but was denied them by [[Commander Dante]] himself. This was shortly before Baal was to be [[Devastation of Baal|invaded]] by [[Hive Fleet Leviathan]] and the Chapter's forces there could spare no one, as they prepared to defend their [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|Homeworld]].{{Fn|1}}

