Asger Warfist.wikitext:
{{DeathwatchPortal}}
{{SpaceWolvesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Wolf Lord]] in the [[Space Wolves]] [[Chapter]] and the first [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Deathwatch]].

==Biography==
Asger was already a [[Wolf Lord]] when the [[Ork]] forces of [[The Beast]] invaded the [[Imperium]]. He took part in his Chapter's battle against the Orks, when they invaded an Imperium [[System]] near the [[Eye of Terror]] and he later successfully led his [[Great Company]] in defending the [[Industrial World|Industrial Moon]] [[Fabrikk]], when it was invaded. Afterwards, he was commanded by his [[Great Wolf]] to travel to [[Terra]], after the Space Wolves received word that their aid was requested{{Fn|1a}} for a strikeforce; to attack the world [[Ullanor]], which was discovered to be the origin point of The Beast's invasion force.{{Fn|1b}}

He later appeared before [[Lord Commander]] [[Koorland]] as part of his Chapter's taskforce on [[Terra]]. He reluctantly tolerated the presence of [[Dark Angels]]{{Fn|1c}} and took part in the invasion of The Beast's homeworld of [[Ullanor]].{{Fn|2}} Warfist later became one of the first members of the [[Deathwatch]] and took part in the destruction of the [[Attack Moon]] over [[Terra]].{{Fn|3}}

Shortly before the second invasion of Ullanor to try and once again slay the Beast, Lord Commander Koorland made Asger Warfist the first [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Deathwatch]]. Warfist fought alongside Koorland as the Lord Commander died against the second "Beast"-class Warboss that revealed himself.{{Fn|4}}

During the third Imperial offensive on Ullanor, Asger Warfist commanded one of the five Imperial attack groups.{{Fn|5}}

