'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Dark Eldar]] Corsair-Lord.{{Fn|1a}}

A sadistic and cruel torturer, Ashterioth became embroiled in a war for possession of the [[Fist of Russ|Fist of Demetrius]] after raiding the [[Macharian Crusade]] warship ''[[Lux Imperatoris]]''.{{Fn|1a}} Once discovering the Fists nature, Ashterioth hoped to use it to access the [[Gate of the Ancients]] in the [[Webway]] in order to acquire lost treasures including the [[Reality Engine]].{{Fn|1a}} 

After a battle on [[Procrastes]], he was confronted by both the military genius of [[Lord Solar]] [[Macharius (Character)|Macharius]] as well as a [[Space Wolves]] strikeforce under the [[Great Wolf]] [[Ulrik Grimfang]]. Ashterioth was forced to flee into the Webway, but the Imperials pursued him.{{Fn|1c}} As Ashterioth reached the Reality Engine, he was wounded by [[Sergeant]] [[Leo Lemuel]], who threw a [[Grenade]] at the device and destabilized it. The wounded Ashterioth was then confronted by Macharius and Space Wolves under the young [[Logan Grimnar]]. Ashterioth was killed when Macharius emptied his [[Bolt Pistol]] into his chest.{{Fn|1d}}

