Ashwood Stranger.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
The '''Ashwood Stranger''' is a hooded [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]] [[Bounty Hunter]] gunfighter{{Fn|1}}, who has been known to surround himself with [[Outlaw Gang|gangs of outcasts]] in [[Hive Primus]]'s [[Underhive]].{{Fn|2}} 
==History==
[[file:Ashwood Stranger3.jpeg|thumb|right|250px|Ashwood Stranger{{Fn|2}}]]
Who he truly is remains a mystery, but some believe the Stranger was once a [[Palanite Enforcer]] due to the single custom [[Equalizer Stub Pistol]] he wields, which is surprisingly similar to Palanite manufacture (he typically wields a custom [[autopistol]] in his other hand). This is added to the fact that the Stranger has a habit of bringing down rogue Enforcers{{Fn|1}} with his own brand of justice{{Fn|2}}, even when the [[Merchant Guild]] will not place a bounty on them{{Fn|1}}. He even uses [[underhive]] [[gang]]s to bring down corrupt Palanite Enforcers{{Fn|2}}, though not all Enforcers are his enemies. The Stranger will even work with the more virtuous of their kind from time to time, if their goals align.{{Fn|1}}

Whoever he truly is, Ashwood Stranger is a force for justice for the powerless. The [[Ash Waste Nomads]] blade he wears on his back hints at the [[bounty hunter]]'s long travels between [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s [[hive]] cities, and when his job is done, the Stranger simply disappears back into the [[Hive World]]'s outlands.{{Fn|1}}

