Aster Felsturn.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
[[file:AsterFelsturn.jpg|thumb|right|220px|Aster Felsturn{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Aster Felsturn''' is a tenacious and endlessly innovative [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]n who has formed an infamous [[Abyssal Ferrymen]] team, with her partner [[Hagthor Jarlun]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
It was during one of Felsturn's ventures into the forbidden ruins of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s [[Hive Secundus]] that [[Hagthor Jarlun|Jarlun]] witnessed her fight off a dozen [[Malstrain Genestealer|Malstrain]] [[Brood Scum]]. After Felsturn emerged victorious, using nothing but a [[jack wrench]] and a desire to survive, Jarlun followed her back to the teeming [[abyssal ferrymen]] settlement of [[Port Styx]]. Seeing an opportunity to make a living, the [[Ironhead Squat Prospector|Ironhead]] convinced Felsturn to work with him as a team of ferrymen and their skills and temperaments have gone on to complement each other. Felsturn is a source of endless innovation and she modifies their equipment, which Jarlun keeps working no matter how outlandish her changes are. This includes her [[Harpy (Armour Rig)|Harpy]] armour rig, which Felsturn has extensively modified. Also, though she is willing to take riskier contracts into Hive Secundus, the more cautious Ironhead makes sure it is nothing the infamous pair can not handle.{{Fn|1}}      
