Athocles Van Roth.wikitext:
{{OrdoXenosPortal}}
'''Athocles Van Roth''' is a [[Radical]] [[Ordo Xenos]] [[Inquisitor]], who sought to end the threat the [[Octarius War]] posed to the [[Imperium]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was given an opportunity to do so, when Roth's ally [[Watch Captain]] [[Daox Glykas]] brought an [[Ork]] [[Baddkrasha's Crown|machine]] to him. It had been created by the [[Big Mek]] [[Baddkrasha]] and when used, it disrupted the synapse used by the [[Tyranid]] species. Roth knew if he could figure out how the machine operated, he would be able to end the Tyranid threat in the Octarius War. In order to do so, Roth gathered an army and travelled to the Tyranid and Ork infested [[Maiden World]] [[Veloria]]. Once there, he began to experiment on the invading Tyranids, in order to master the use of Baddkrasha's machine.{{Fn|1}}

