Aton Marner.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Aton Marner''' was a [[Rogue Trader]] and a scion of [[House Marner]], who was active in the [[Koronus Expanse]] in mid-[[M41]].{{Fn|1a}}

==History==
He came into conflict with the [[Rogue Trader]] [[Cassius Sult]] in 520.[[M41]], in what became known as the [[Battle of Embers]]. It began over the exploitation of a mineral-rich [[asteroid belt]] near [[Falcon's Fall Gamma]], and caused a blood feud between their [[Rogue Trader House|Houses]].{{Fn|1a}}

The feud between [[House Marner]] and [[House Sult]] still rages to this day.{{Fn|1a}} Aton's part in the conflict, however, ended in 577.[[M41]] after [[Hyperia Sult]]'s warship launched a daring ambush that killed Aton aboard his own warship's bridge. His death not only worsened the blood feud, but also sparked a succession crisis in [[House Marner]]. This was ultimately resolved when the House's [[Warrant of Trade]] was passed to Anton's granddaughter, [[Cara Marner|Cara]].{{Fn|1b}}   

