Attilus.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Attilus the Axe''' is a legendary member of [[House Goliath]] active in [[Hive Primus]], who made his name while fighting in the [[Fist (Necromunda)|Fist]] stronghold's '''House of Pain''' arena.{{Fn|1}}

==History==
[[Image:Attilus.jpg|thumb|right|220px|Attilus{{Fn|2}}]]
Attilus the Axe has been the reigning champion of the House of Pain arena for over a hundred great-cycles, far longer than any to come before him. Originally, Attilus was a forge master from the Fist of Hive Primus, he began his life bent over a lathe-anvil, crafting brute cleavers and [[renderizer]]s for the clan. When the great Goliath blacksmith forged his masterpiece, a [[chainaxe]] [[Imperial bionics|cyber arm]] of prodigious size and sharpness, he trusted no one but himself to test its blade in the pit. Dubbed the [[God Cleaver]], Attilus hacked off his own arm so he could fix the monstrosity in place, turning himself into as savage a [[pit fighter]] as the clan had ever seen.{{Fn|2}}

Attilus and his axe arm drew huge crowds from the hive city, and over a gruesome season of murder, Attilus rose to become the star pit fighter of the House of Pain , turning the arena red with his kills. The [[Spyder-Twins]], [[Willowfex|Willowfex the Reaper]] and the [[Slave Ogryn]] [[Hammerstein]] all fell to God Cleaver. Huge sums were offered for beasts from Hive Bottom just to test Attilus’ skills, and led to the pit fighter earning a new title: '''Attilus the Undefeated'''. These days Attilus still fights in the pits, but can be coaxed away by a Goliath [[gang]] for the right price.{{Fn|2}}

==Sources==
