Augustus Flax.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Augustus Flax''' was the [[Imperial Commander|Governor]] of the [[Imperium|Imperial]] planet [[Asphodex]] and head of the [[Flaxian Dynasty]] at the time of the [[Cryptus Campaign]].{{Fn|1a}}

Augustus was the first and only child of his parents and heir to the Flaxian Dynasty until his parents left Asphodex on a trading mission to [[Satys]]. When they returned, Augustus's mother was pregnant and she declared that her new son, [[Spawn of Cryptus|Tiberius Flax]], would be named heir instead of Augustus. The child was born [[Genestealer Patriarch|a horrific mutant]] but despite this, Augustus's parents still wished for Tiberius to ascend to the throne. Augustus led a coup, seizing the throne of Asphodex and killing his parents, but Tiberius was able to escape into the undercity of [[Phodia]].{{Fn|1b}}

Augustus was still the governor when the [[tyranid]]s of [[Hive Fleet Leviathan]] invaded the [[Cryptus System]]. [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Karlaen]] led a detachment of the [[1st Company (Blood Angels)|Blood Angels 1st Company]] to evacuate him or, failing that, to retrieve a sample of his blood, as [[Sanguinary High Priest]] [[Corbulo]] believed that the DNA of the Flaxian Dynasty could help him develop a cure for the [[Red Thirst]].{{Fn|1a}} Karlaen made his way into Augustus's hidden bunker, unwittingly leading the [[Spawn of Cryptus]] to his position.{{Fn|1b}}

