Aulus Scaramanca.wikitext:
{{IronWarriorsPortal}}
'''Aulus Scaramanca''' was a [[Techmarine]]-in-training in the [[Iron Warriors]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Initially loyal to the [[Imperium]], and training on [[Mars]] to become a full techmarine he was assumed killed during [[Schism of Mars|the schism]] by corrupted mechanicum machines. In actuality he survived and was found by the [[Dark Mechanicum]] who turned him into a giant mechanical construct. The resulting heavily corrupted Scaramanca was charged with fortifying Mars in preparation for the arrival of the [[Horus  Lupercal|Warmaster]]. Scaramanca judged that the [[Vertex Australis]] was Mars' greatest weakpoint and set out to fortify the area. While fortifying the Vertex Australis, Scaramanca came into conflict with the [[Tabula Myriad]] which sought to destroy the ancient machine. During this conflict the heavily corrupted warrior was eventually slain by the [[Knights-Errant|Knight-Errant]] [[Dravian Klayde]] who was on a mission on [[Mars]] to assist the Tabula Myriad.{{Fn|2}}

==Sources==
