Aulus Sejanus.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Aulus Sejanus''' is the [[Sector Lord]] of the [[Imperium]]'s [[Macharian Sector]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
However the [[Imperium]] now only holds a portion of what [[Lord Commander Solar]] [[Macharius (Character)|Macharius]] [[Macharian Crusade|brought]] into [[Compliance]]. Adding to both the [[Macharian Sector]] and Sejanus' woes, was the [[Great Rift]]'s [[Noctis Aeterna]], which caused the worlds that remained in the Imperium's control to suffer greatly. The region is now wracked by wide-spread anarchy and sedition, though Sejanus is seeking to rebuild the shattered Sector. Despite his efforts, though, many are opposing or even suborning the Sector Lord's plans to do so.{{Fn|1}}

