Ba'stien Grix.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Ba'stien Grix''' is the [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Castellans of the Rift]].{{fn|1}}
==History==
The [[Chapter]] was formed on the orders of [[Lord Commander]] [[Guilliman]] and were charged by him with defending the [[Nachmund Gauntlet]] for the [[Imperium]]. However, when combat losses put this duty at risk, the [[Castellans of the Rift|Castellans]] sought aid to help them in their task and Grix send out messages requesting reinforcements from their fellow Space Marine Chapters. The messages were received and the forces that arrived to fight beside the Castellans, became known as the [[Wardens of the Gauntlet]].{{fn|1}}

During the [[Nachmund Rift War]], Grix was the senior Imperial commander during the Siege of [[Dharrovar]] and was wounded leading a retreat from the world.{{Fn|2}}

