Baldur Kord.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a member of the [[Imperial Fists]] [[6th Company (Imperial Fists Legion)|6th Company]], serving in the Company's 2nd Assault Echelon.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
[[Image:BaldurKord.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
Kord was a [[Terra]]n, although the majority of his brothers in the 6th company were born on [[Inwit]].{{Fn|1}} 

The 2nd assault echelon is one of the first units of the VII Legion to be equipped with the [[Cataphractii Armour]], and its warriors where masters in a range of heavy assault doctrines. In the [[Battle of Phall]], all the Legionaries in Terminator armour were gathered into one unit and placed under the command of [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Amandus Tyr]], Kord's commanding officer. Tyr led an attack on the ''[[Iron Blood]]'' in a desperate mission to kill the [[Primarch]] [[Perturabo]] and the 2nd assault Echelon went into battle with it. Very little is known about this attack, as contact became impossible as battle was underway. When in the last stages of the Battle of Phall the ships of the Imperial Fists began to withdraw from the battle with the [[Iron Warriors]], it was impossible to recall the Imperial Fists on board.{{Fn|1}}

==Wargear==
Kord was equipped with a [[Phaestos (Forge World)|Phaestos]] pattern [[heavy flamer]].{{Fn|1}}

Kord wore black and white, typical for his company heraldry. The armorial shield his shoulder indicates that Kord is a Senior member of the vanguard assault unit and is decorated with additional icons of the moment.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[The Horus Heresy Book Three - Extermination]], pg. 70

