Bannon.wikitext:
{{DeathwatchPortal}}
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
[[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] '''Bannon''' was a [[Space Marine]] from the [[Imperial Fists]] [[chapter]]. He served as [[Watch Captain|Captain]] of the [[Deathwatch]] [[Kill Team]] summoned to [[Tarsis Ultra]] in late [[M41]] to assist [[Lord Inquisitor]] [[Kryptman]] in combating the [[Tyranid]]s from [[Hive Fleet]] [[Leviathan]].{{Fn|1a}}

==Biography==
Bannon's steadfastness and leadership were crucial to the campaign at several times. When a [[Lictor]] appeared in the city of [[Erebus (City)|Erebus]], Bannon led the Deathwatch team in the near-impossible task of capturing it alive, as Kryptmann insisted.{{Fn|1b}}

He subsequently led his team on an extremely hazardous mission to power a ground-based [[Defence Laser]] located behind the main Tyranid swarm. Firing the cannon, in conjunction with a naval attack led by the [[Strike Cruiser]] ''[[Vae Victus]]'', allowed the defending forces to destroy one of the two remaining Tyranid [[Hive Ship]]s controlling the swarm.{{Fn|1c}}{{Fn|1d}}.

As their position was overrun by the attacking Tyranids, Bannon was the last to be rappelled aboard the airborne [[Thunderhawk]] extracting the team. When his leg was caught by a monstrous [[Tyranid Warrior|Warrior]], Bannon cut his line, sacrificing himself rather than drag the rest of the team to their deaths. He was last seen going down under a swarm of Tyranids, armed with nothing but a [[power weapon|power knife]], fighting to his last breath.{{Fn|1c}}

Command of the kill team briefly fell to Brother [[Henghast]], but was assumed by [[Uriel Ventris]] for the team's assault on the final Hive Ship.{{Fn|1d}}

