Bartizan Nikol.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Bartizan Nikol''' was a [[Techmarine]] in the [[Castellans of the Rift]] [[Chapter]].{{fn|1}}
==History==
Like all [[Castellans of the Rift|Castellans]], Nikol defended the [[Nachmund Gauntlet]] for the [[Imperium]]. Among the many battles he fought to do so, was against the [[Space Hulk]] [[Lament of Ages]], when it threatened the Imperial [[Moon]] [[Siboseis]]. Nikol was serving under [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Tenalus Proteik|Proteik]] at that time and the Captain was adamant that he would protect the Moon from the Space Hulk. Thanks to Nikol's scanning efforts, a fault was found within the Lament of Ages and Proteik's forces could steer it away from Siboseis, using a warhead from his [[Strike Cruiser]] [[Dark Sentry (Strike Cruiser)|Dark Sentry]]. However after they entered the Space Hulk, the Castellans were constantly attacked by the forces of [[Chaos]] and various [[Xenos]]. They eventually reached the Lament's fault line and prepared the warhead to detonate, while still being attacked. After it was ready to be activated, though, Nikol realized some of the Castellans would need to protect the warhead, from the Spacehulk's inhabitants, until it exploded. The Techmarine was the first to volunteer and the rest of Captain Proteik's forces soon followed. The Captain quickly picked ten other Castellans to remain with Nikol, while the rest of his forces made their escape. They were then able to safely return to their fleet, before the warhead exploded and the Lament of Ages was sent careering away from Siboseis. Thanks to Nikol and the others' sacrifice, the Moon's population was saved and Proteik vowed their names would be remembered with the greatest of honors.{{fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[White Dwarf 475]], pgs. 66-67 - ''Flashpoint: Nachmund - The Acts of the Wardens''
