'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a past [[Space Marine Captain|Master]] of the [[Dark Angels]] [[Chapter|Chapter's]] [[3rd Company (Dark Angels)|Third Company]].{{Fn|1}}

In [[M41]], {{PAGENAME}} arrived on the [[Mining World]] [[Truan IX]] to end a rebellion. However, his [[Space Marine Company|Company]] was savaged by the unthinking population, which Batheus learned was under the influence of a [[Daemon]] that had been imprisoned within the world's mines. To end the Daemon's threat, the Third Company fought its way to the mines, but the Daemon became aware of the Dark Angels and overwhelmed them with its power. While under its thrall, Batheus and what remained of his Company were forced to mindlessly turn upon one another and in the slaughter that followed, only the [[Battle Brother]] [[Azrael]] remained alive. Azrael was able to regain his senses, though, and resisted the Daemon's powers long enough to destroy it.{{Fn|1}}

