==History==
The [[24th Ventrillian Nobles|24th]] are among the [[Imperium]]'s forces, that are defending [[Montar VII]] from an [[Ork]] invasion. However during the course of the battle there, an attack{{Fn|1a}} by the [[Goffs]] [[Warboss]] [[Skogrin]]{{Fn|1b}} separated the 24th from the Imperium's main military formation. Skogrin's horde then pursued the [[Regiment]] and the 24th's [[Imperial Guard Captain|Company Commander]], [[Stromfjord]], led them to seek refuge at the [[Grox]] farm of the Imperial citizen [[Ortan Glazer]].{{Fn|1a}} Skogrin's horde attacked shortly afterwards,{{Fn|1b}} and while he was new to the Regiment, Bauhin commanded its [[Guardsmen]] well{{Fn|1c}} and was protected by his [[Ogryn Bodyguard]] and [[Colour Sergeant]] [[Brawn]].{{Fn|1b}} Though the Orks attacked the farm in waves throughout the battle, the Ventrillians were able to kill so many of them, that the Warboss retreated from the farm. Afterwards, Bauhin found the wounded Stromfjord amongst the dead and told the commander the state the battered 24th Regiment was in, as they sought out a [[medic]].{{Fn|1d}}
