Bell (Inquisitor).wikitext:
{{InquisitionPortal}}
{{Fanatic}}
'''Bell''' is an [[Inquisitor]].{{Fn|1a}} 
==History==
He has clashed several times with the [[Rogue Trader]] [[Vogel (Rogue Trader)|Vogel]]. The first instance occurred, when Vogel attempted to destroy a [[Nuclear Weapon|tactical nuclear missile]] on an [[Imperial]] world. This was to ensure the Rogue Trader's dealings with [[heretics]] on the world, were hidden from its authorities. However, Bell sought to launch the nuke at the world's southern continent to destroy the Heretics instead.{{Fn|1a}} 

The two later clashed again, in the [[Imperial]] '''Vamhorn Stadium''', when [[Vogel (Rogue Trader)|Vogel]] sold an [[Archeotech]] shield generator to the [[Pirate]] leader [[Red Dog]]. This was despite knowing that Red Dog intended to use it to seal off and take control of the city the stadium was located in. But the [[Rogue Trader]] will not be paid by the Pirate leader, until the Archeotech was finished being installed in the stadium and was operational. As this is occurring, the shield generator is being watched over by Vogel's hired thug [[Krystis]], and several of Red Dog's pirates. Bell though, knows about the Pirate leader's plans and he is racing to stop the shield generator from being activated.{{Fn|1b}} 
