{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
'''Belphegor''' is a [[Dark Angels]] [[Interrogator-Chaplain]].{{Fn|1}}

Taking part in the [[Siege of Vraks]], he helped lead the hunt for the [[Alpha Legion]] Warlord [[Arkos the Faithless]]. Meeting the Alpha Legion Warlord's warband, [[The Faithless]], in battle, Belphegor saved the life of [[Dark Angels Grand Master|Supreme Grand Master]] [[Azrael]] by intervening before Arkos could strike the [[Chapter Master]] down.{{Fn|1}}

Later towards the end of the siege, Arkos was cornered and managed to strike down [[Master]] [[Yafrir]]. Belphegor then engaged the traitor astartes in combat, sending Arkos reeling with a single blow from his [[Crozius Arcanum]] and allowing him to be captured.{{Fn|1}}

