Beltayn.wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Beltayn''' was a [[Guardsman]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}


==Biography==
Beltayn was one of the original members of the First and Only from [[Tanith]]. One of the younger Guardsmen to serve in the [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]], he often acted as a [[loader]] for the [[Guardsman#Heavy Gunner|Heavy Weapons Trooper]] [[Bragg|"Try Again" Bragg]].{{Fn|1}} He would later become a [[vox]]-[[trooper]].{{Fn|2}}

While part of an advance party of Tanith sent to scout the ruined city of [[Kosdorf]] on [[Voltemand]], Beltayn was shot in the arm by a [[Chaos|corrupted]] [[PDF]] trooper with a [[lasgun]]. The wound proved minor, however.{{Fn|1}}

Beltayn eventually became the [[adjutant]] of the Tanith First's CO, [[Colonel-Commissar]] [[Ibram Gaunt]], after Gaunt's previous adjutant, [[Brin Milo]], came of age and enlisted in the Guard proper.{{Fn|3}}

Beltayn was noted for his habit of understating problems; even in extremely dire situations, he would often say that things were merely "awry".{{Fn|2}}

