Bemenacth.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Bemenacth''' was a [[Wraithlord]] of [[Craftworld]] [[Iyanden]].{{Fn|1}}

A hero to the [[Eldar]] of Iyanden, she was killed fighting in the [[Battle of the Dying Sun]]. After her death, her [[Spirit Stone]] was interred within a Wraithlord and she continued to fight for her Craftworld. Bemenacth was later awoken to assist [[Spiritseer]] [[Shear'ann]] when Iyanden's forces were faring badly in a battle with an [[Evil Sunz]] [[Warboss|Warlord]] and his horde. The location of the Warlord had been discovered and Shear'ann led Bemenacth and a group [[Wraithguard]] to ambush the Warlord and hopefully turn the battle to the Craftworld's favor. The Ork Warlord approached their hidden location in a [[Battle Wagon]] and as Shear'ann led his Wraithguard into battle, Bemenacth claimed the Ork's life as hers and advanced ahead of them. Weathering the Orks' fire upon her, she single-handedly destroyed the Battle Wagon and after a brief battle with the Warlord, tore him in half.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[White Dwarf 246 (UK)]], pg. 9

