The [[Crusade Fleet]] was later among the [[Imperial]] reinforcements that came to the aid of the [[Imperium]]'s [[Sigma-Ulstari System]]. At that time, its defenders were nearly defeated, after the [[System]] had been repeatedly invaded by [[Orks]] and the [[Tyranids]] of [[Hive Fleet Leviathan]]. As the reinforcements dispersed their forces to its worlds, [[High Marshal (Black Templars)|High Marshal]] [[Helbrecht]] charged Kiergaard with dispatching a strike force to [[Abundantia]]. Besides his fellow [[Black Templars]], the [[Castellan (Black Templars)|Castellan]] also sent the fanatics of the [[Imperial Cult|Cult Imperialis]] and oath-bound [[Knight]]s of [[House T'orvanosh]], to aid the besieged [[Agri World]].{{Fn|1}} 

