Bhag'wahdas.wikitext:
{{TauPortal}}
'''Bhag'wahdas''' is a [[Ethereal]] in the [[T'au Empire]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He serves in the [[Taros Sector]], where Bhag'wahdas is known for his hatred of the [[Imperium]]. However the atrocities the [[Ethereal]] and the [[T'au Empire]] have committed throughout the Imperial [[Sector]] has earned him its ire. Bhag'wahdas was declared '''Sanctus Purgatus''' by the [[Ordo Xenos]] for his actions, though extreme caution was advised by any Imperials who attacked him. For it is rumored the Ethereal has the ability to control any machines that are near him. Bhag'wahdas was later among{{Fn|1}} the T'au Empire's [[Third Sphere of Expansion]] forces{{Fn|2}} that invaded the Imperial [[Sector]]s near the [[Damocles Gulf]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]]. However they were then attacked by the Imperium in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Mont'shi Campaign]]{{Fn|3}} and the Ethereal was made a priority target.{{Fn|1}} In the end though, the T'au were victorious{{Fn|3}} and Bhag'wahdas survived the conflict.{{Fn|1}} 
