==History==
However when a [[General]]'s [[Valkyrie]] is shot down into [[Dasht i-Kevar]]'s endless and implacable desert by the [[T'au]], only the [[Kasrkin]] stand a chance of rescuing him. Obeysekera's squadron is chosen for this vital mission, which could decide the fate of Dasht i-Kevaras, as the General has knowledge that could aid the [[Xenos]] in claiming the world. The dangers are many though, as the [[Imperial Guard Captain|Captain]]'s Kasrkin will be caught off from support due to the desert's sand storms and they are not the only ones hunting for the General. Worse still, the war for Dasht i-Kevar has caught the attention of something ancient lurking beneath the desert sands.{{Fn|1}}

