The '''Blind King''' was a rogue [[Tech Priest]] of the [[Adeptus Mechanicus]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
The Blind King was a native of [[Mars]] who joined the ranks of the Missionary Order of the [[Collegia Titanica]]'s [[Collegia Titanica#Divisio Mandati|Divisio Mandati]].{{Fn|3}} He rose to the position of [[Archmagos]] of the Adeptus Mechanicus,{{Fn|2}} before concluding that humanity was an affront to the [[Omnissiah]]. He gathered so-called "Apostles" within the Mechanicus and launch the [[Occlusiad War]] (in 550.[[M37]]), a devastating conflict that lasted over a decade.{{Fn|1}}

There exist conflicting accounts of the Blind King's death. It is generally believed that he was killed when the [[Emperor Class Battleship]] ''[[Dominus Astra]]'' discovered his palace-warship in the [[Warp]] and destroyed it with [[lance]] fire.  Without their leader his Apostles swiftly scattered and the Occlusiad War finally came to an end.{{Fn|1}} In contrast, the [[Dark Hunters]] believe that they killed the Blind King when he invaded their homeworld [[Phobian]].{{Fn|3}}

