Bolaraphon.wikitext:
{{IronWarriorsPortal}}
'''Bolaraphon''' was a [[Warsmith]] of the [[Iron Warriors]].{{Fn|1a}}

==History==
At one point, Bolaraphon was the [[Chaos Lord|Lord]] of the [[Dru'Kashyl]], a fortified network of asteroids accompanied by a fleet of several dozen warships. However, at the onset of the [[Noctis Aeterna]], the Dru'Kashyl was devastated by the tides of the [[Warp]] as the [[Great Rift]] opened. Though Bolaraphon and his warband were able to escape aboard the ''[[Damnatio Memorae]]'', the rest of the fleet and the asteroid belt were engulfed by the [[Warp Storm]] and lost.{{Fn|1a}}

Later {{PAGENAME}} hatched an ambitious plan to kill the resurrected [[Roboute Guilliman]]. He [[Battle of Quradim|invaded the world of Quradim]], overwhelming its [[Genesis Chapter]] defenders and securing a cache of [[Virus Bomb]]s. However [[Indomitus Crusade]] forces consisting of [[Ultramarines]] [[Chaplain]] [[Helios (Ultramarines)|Helios]] arrived, and soon after them a large crusade fleet led personally by Guilliman.{{Fn|1b}} As the Ultramarines destroyed the ''Damnatio Memorae'', Bolaraphon hoped to lure Guilliman to Quradim and detonate the virus bombs. Bolaraphon was seemingly defeated by Helios.{{Fn|1c}}

However Bolaraphon was able to survive and comes across a single virus bomb warhead, which he is able to detonate as a last sacrificial act of betrayal, though Guilliman was able to escape before it engulfed the planet.{{Fn|1d}}

