[[Interrogator-Chaplain]] Boreas extracted the famous testimony of the [[Fallen Angel]] and Ex-[[Dark Angels]] Chapter Master [[Astelan]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==

At some point Boreas fought in the liberation of the Kumenar Gap alongside [[Zadakiel]], and drove back the [[Arch Daemon]] [[Char Gar Kethekon]]. After the battle he gave Zadakiel a special bolt round, inscribed with litanies, cast from metal from the shadow of the [[Imperial Palace]], and blessed by 13 [[Imperial Saints]].{{Fn|3}}

In 960.[[M41]] Boreas took part in the [[Pandorax Campaign]]. He was part of the battle on the asteroid Malefus Murex, and like other [[Interrogator Chaplain|Interrogator Chaplain's]], had to collect the [[Gene-seed]] of the dead [[Chaos Space Marines]] for testing later on [[The Rock]]. When we went among the [[Khorne Berzerker|Khorne Berzerkers]] that had been fought off by [[Ezekiel]], [[Belial]] and other librarians, he found it hard to figure out which body parts belonged to which corpse.{{Fn|2}}

