At one point in the [[Kalidar War]], the 7th Paragonian were part of an Imperial detachment located in [[Macaree's Tablelands]]; the 7th's tanks were powered down for routine maintenance while a number of the company's officers were at a function aboard the [[Command Leviathan]] ''[[Magnificence (Leviathan)|Magnificence]]''.{{Fn|1c}} However, under the cover of a sandstorm, an [[ork]] warband attacked the Imperial positions.{{Fn|1c}}{{Fn|1d}} Brasslock and Urtho were forced to fight the orks in order to defend the tanks, killing more than a dozen. Unfortunately the orks overwhelmed their defence, destroying Urtho and kidnapping Brasslock.{{Fn|1d}}

Following the conclusion of the Kalidar War he was promoted to [[Enginseer Primus]] and was reassigned to the [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment's]] command tank, the [[Hellhammer]] ''[[Ostrakhan's Rebirth]]''.{{Fn|2}}

