{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
[[Image:Brawn.jpg|thumb|right|180px|Brawn{{Fn|1b}}]]
'''Brawn''' is an [[Ogryn Bodyguard]] and [[Colour Sergeant]] to the [[24th Ventrillian Nobles]] [[Regiment]]'s '''Vanguard''' [[Imperial Guard Captain|Company Commander]], [[Bauhin]].{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
The [[24th Ventrillian Nobles|24th]] are among the [[Imperium]]'s forces, that are defending [[Montar VII]] from an [[Ork]] invasion. However during the course of the battle there, an attack{{Fn|1a}} by the [[Goffs]] [[Warboss]] [[Skogrin]]{{Fn|1b}} separated the 24th from the Imperium's main military formation. Skogrin's horde then pursued the [[Regiment]] and the 24th's [[Imperial Guard Captain|Company Commander]], [[Stromfjord]], led them to seek refuge at the [[Grox]] farm of the Imperial citizen [[Ortan Glazer]].{{Fn|1a}} Skogrin's horde attacked shortly afterwards,{{Fn|1b}} but the Ventrillians were able to kill so many of the Orks, that the Warboss retreated from the farm.{{Fn|1c}}
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
''Brawn'' and the [[24th Ventrillian Nobles]] were created by the [[Games Workshop]] employee [[Chris Peach]]. They were featured in [[White Dwarf June 2018]].{{Fn|1b}}

