Breaker Brass.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Breaker Brass''' is a [[Slave Ogryn]] who was once owned by the [[Slag Krocs]] [[House Goliath]] gang{{Fn|1}} before he started a slave revolution in [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s [[Hive Primus]].{{Fn|2}}

He had previously enjoyed making things in [[House Goliath]]'s forges and had been very loyal and protective of the members of the [[Slag Krocs]]{{Fn|1}}. However, all this changed when Breaker was injured in one of the gang's battles and was left to die. Breaker was able to not only survive his wounds, but also discovered that his intelligence had greatly increased. With this newfound ability, Breaker decided to start a slave revolution to free himself from the Slag Krocs and House Goliath.{{Fn|2}}

