Breccia.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Breccia''' was a [[Trooper]] of the [[Hyrkan Eighth]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]], active during the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]]. He usually served as his [[Imperial Guard Squad|squadron's]] [[minesweeper]].{{Fn|1}}

He was amongst those Hyrkans deployed on [[Formal Prime]] during [[Operation Redrake|the first major phase]] of the Crusade. While on Formal Prime, his squad was sent ahead of [[Imperial]] lines to the [[Underhive|underlayers]] of [[Sangrel Hive]] to assist a survey team lead by [[Wal Desruisseaux]] which had uncovered a shrine to [[Saint Sabbat]]. However, the "shrine" turned out to be a prison containing something that would aid the forces of [[Chaos]] in the region and Desruisseaux was actually a [[Charismites|Charismite]] [[Chaos cultist]]. Desruisseaux tried to kill the Guardsmen so he could use their equipment to unseal the prison, but was killed in the ensuing firefight by [[Zennet]], the squad's [[Sharpshooter]].{{Fn|1}}

