Bredek.wikitext:
{{RedCorsairsPortal}}
'''Bredek the Unburdened''' is an ever dour and downcast [[Chaos Space Marine Apothecary]], who was once a member of the [[Red Corsairs]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] before he was exiled for unknown reasons.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He now offers his services in a grimy little stall within the [[Kritsyarrk Station]], which is the home to a dozen [[Chaos Space Marine]] [[Chaos Warband|Warbands]]. Despite its appearances, however, Bredek has the equipment and supplies to carry out his work and is aided by a number of [[Servo-imp]]s. He even knows how to implant the [[Butcher's Nails]], despite not being one of [[World Eaters]]' [[Berzerker-surgeon]]s, and Bredek had done the procedure a number of times, before he was exiled by their [[Chaos Lord]] [[Huron Blackheart]]. [[The Foresworn (World Eaters)|The Foresworn]]'s Chief Vivisector, [[Perun Tiyr]], studied the implantation work Bredek did on the [[Berzerker]] [[Kurrinon]] and stated it was done with a singular lack of skill. To the point, that Tiyr almost admired the incompetence with which the Butcher's Nails had been attached to Kurrinon's brain. This is likely the reason why Kurrinon suffered more under the effects of the Nails, than other World Eaters.{{Fn|1}}  

==Sources==
