Brennan (Tanith).wikitext:
{{TanithPortal}}
'''Brennan''' was a [[Guardsman]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Brennan served from the [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment's]] inception on [[Tanith]]. In the Tanith First's third theatre, [[Caligula (Hive World)|Caligula]], the [[troop-ship]] Brennan was riding in was brought down by a [[Psyker|psychic storm]] in the forest caldera [[K7-75]].{{Fn|1}}

Brennan was pinned in the hold by the wreckage and although the others were able to free him, his wounds were bad enough that [[Major]] [[Elim Rawne|Rawne]] advocated leaving him and the other wounded behind or mercy-killing them. However [[Colonel-Commissar]] [[Ibram Gaunt|Gaunt]], the regiment's commander, chose to take Brennan and the others with them. Sure enough, thanks to Gaunt's leadership, all of the survivors of the crash made it off Caligula in one piece, despite a fight against a number of [[Chaos Cult]]ists.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
