Brython Semper.wikitext:
{{ImperialNavyPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Lord Admiral]] of the [[Imperial Armada]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1a}}

==Biography==
Semper was recruited into the Armada on the world of [[Cypra Mundi]]. By the time of the Horus Heresy, Semper had command of an entire [[Battlefleet]] consisting of more than forty ships above the world of [[Molech]], which he led his battlefleet from the [[Avenger Grand Cruiser]] ''[[Guardian of Aquinas]]''.{{Fn|1a}}

When Molech was [[Battle of Molech|invaded]] by the treacherous [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]], he led a tenacious resistance{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}}, but ultimately his flagship was boarded in a party led by Horus himself. When the traitors reached his deck Horus told Semper that he had fought honourably, and if he lowered his sword more bloodshed would be avoided. Semper's response was to yell "For the Imperium!" and charge at Horus, [[Power Sword]] in hand. Disappointed, Horus casually struck him down.{{Fn|1b}}

==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
*Brython Semper's surname is a play on words detonating his valiant last stand against Horus and faithfulness to the Imperium, referencing the Latin phrase ''Semper Fidelis'' which means "Always Faithful".

