Burning Ones.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}{{NecromundaPortal}}
The '''Burning Ones''' are among a number of [[Daemons]], that some in the depths of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s [[Hive Primus]] sometimes call upon.{{Fn|1}} 

Those facing death, can desperately call upon them in order to live beyond their allotted life-span and the [[Daemon]]s are able to grant that last wish for a price. Those marked by the Burning Ones, however, will be required to conduct [[Human]] sacrifices to the Daemons in order to sustain their lives. In time, though, the powers granted by the Burning Ones will eventually turn their victims into [[Chaos Spawns]].{{Fn|1}}

