'''Burone''' was a [[Verghast]]ite{{Fn|1}} [[Guardsman]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}


==Biography==
Burone was one of the [[Verghast]]ite recruits brought in to reinforce the regiment following the [[Siege of Vervunhive]], initially holding the rank of [[Trooper]]. He was assigned to a minesweeper unit, often acting in parallel with the [[Tanith]] Trooper [[Domor]].{{Fn|1}}

