Butcher King.wikitext:
{{KhornePortal}}
The '''Butcher King''' was the name given to one of the eight individuals which made up the mysterious [[Hand of Abaddon]], an organization within the [[Black Legion]] dedicated to reconstituting the [[Anathame]].{{Fn|1a}}

==History==
Taking the position as 2nd of the Hand, the Butcher King was a [[Khornate]] [[Chaos Space Marine]] of unknown origin. Wearing a crimson cloak and ancient [[Space Marine Power Armour|Power Armour]], he was highly aggressive, bloodthirsty, and ferocious. The Butcher King commanded a force of [[Khorne Berzerker]]s as well as crazed Khornate [[Cultist]]s and [[Mutant]]s.{{Fn|1b}}

During the [[Battle of the Stygius Gilt]] the Butcher King ambushed incoming Imperial forces boarding the [[Blackstone Fortress]] used by the Hand as their base. However he was met by [[Ultramarines]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Ferren Areios]] and killed.{{Fn|1b}}

