Byron.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Byron''' is an [[Astra Militarum]] [[Imperial Guard Sergeant|Sergeant]] in the [[8th Cadian]] [[Regiment]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
{{Spoiler|source=Space Marine II}}
They were among the [[Imperial]] forces that aided in the defense of the [[Tyranid]] invaded [[Recidious System]]. During the campaign to save the [[System]], Byron was among the [[8th Cadian]] that defended [[Kadaku]] from the [[Xenos]]. When the decision was later made to abandon the world, the [[Imperial Guard Sergeant|Sergeant]] aided in the evacuation effort. Under the command of [[Major]] [[Sarkaana]], Byron was defending an [[Astra Militarum]] base that [[Archmagos]] [[Nozick Beta-12]] was taken to after his facility was attacked by Tyranids. Though she was charged with evacuating the Archmagos, Nozick refused to leave without the data of the [[Project Aurora|secret project]] he was working on. In order to complete her mission, the [[Major]] sent three squadrons to the Archmagos' facility, which included one led by Byron. However, Sarkaana lost contact with all of them and thought they had been killed by the Tyranids.{{Fn|1}} 

While the fate of the other two was unknown, Byron and his squadron still lived, though they had suffered heavy casualties. However with their [[Vox]] damaged, their fate would have been sealed had they not encountered the [[Ultramarines]]' [[Combat Squad Damocles]]. They were members of the [[Chapter]]'s [[2nd Company (Ultramarines)|2nd Company]], which had also been aiding in defending the [[Recidious System]], and were led by their commander, [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] [[Demetrian Titus]]. They had been sent by their [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]], [[Sevastus Acheran]], to evacuate [[Archmagos]] [[Nozick Beta-12]] as well, but had run into the same difficulties with him, that the [[8th Cadian]] had. Titus racing towards the Archmagos' facility to retrieve the data, when he encountered Byron's squadron being attacked by Tyranids. After saving the [[Guardsmen]], Titus then contacted [[Sarkaana]] about the squadron and the [[Major]] sent a [[Valkyrie]] to transport Byron and the other survivors them back to her base. The Astra Militarum base was later under attack by the Tyranids, however, when Nozick successfully received the data from Titus. The Archmagos was then evacuated, as the 8th Cadian stayed behind and continued to defend the base from the [[Xenos]]. It is not known if Byron survived the battle.{{Fn|1}}  

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Space Marine II]] - ''Mission 2, Severance''

