Caelos.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was the last [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Scar Lords]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1a}}

Elected as Steward Chapter Master following the demise of [[Durian Raevor]] during the [[Damocles Crusade]], Caelos sought to exact vengeance upon [[Commander Farsight]] for his Chapter's humiliation. To that end, he orchestrated an [[Battle of Vior'los|invasion of Vior'los]].{{Fn|1a}} Caelos initially succeeded in occupying Vior'los but was faced with a renewed counterattack by Farsight and his small band of [[The Eight|followers]].{{Fn|1b}} As he battled Farsight, the Tau under [[O'Vesa]] caused a mass volcanic eruption by overloading Vior'los' magma power generators. Caelos knew the situation was hopeless and ordered the orbiting [[Battle Barge]] ''[[Scabbard of Flesh]]'' destroy Vior'los with [[Virus Bomb]]s as he was killed when he was swept away by lava. However Farsight had anticipated such an action, and had [[Ob'lotai]] fly through the vessels [[Macrocannon]] barrel and detonate the munitions within, wiping out the Scar Lords Chapter.{{Fn|1c}}

