Cal'ton Ravensword.wikitext:
{{RavenGuardPortal}}
'''Cal'ton Ravensword'''{{Fn|1}} is a former{{Fn|2}} [[Chief Librarian]] of the [[Raven Guard]], who has always followed the teachings of the [[Chapter]]'s [[Primarch]], [[Corvus Corax]], and the [[Emperor]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He has few peers in the arts of combat and [[psychic]] control, which Ravensword teaches to the [[Raven Guard]]'s [[Librarian]]s.{{Fn|1}} When the [[Imperium]] launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]],{{Fn|3}} the [[Chief Librarian]] was among its forces that fought{{Fn|1}} the [[T'au Empire]] in the [[Mont'shi Campaign]].{{Fn|4}} Ravensword thought the T'au's message of the [[Greater Good]] was laughable, as the only greater good he acknowledged was the [[Emperor]]'s will. He would then vow to use the Emperor's light to cleanse the T'au he faced in battle.{{Fn|1}} While the Mont'shi Campaign eventually ended in failure,{{Fn|3}} Ravensword survived the Crusade.{{Fn|1}} He was later replaced as the Raven Guard's Chief Librarian, which is currently [[Taalis Shraek]].{{Fn|2}} 
