'''Calistus, The Flamebringer''' is a [[Battle Brother]] in the [[Ultramarines]], who wields a [[Flamer]] in battle. He has served the [[Chapter]] for 97 years and he is currently attached to [[Jaenos Sevastus|Squad Sevastus]]{{Fn|1}} in [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Anaton Thassarius]]'{{Fn|2}} [[2nd Company (Ultramarines)|2nd Company]].{{Fn|1}}

