He is also known for wielding a [[Flamer]], which Calistus used to great affect on [[Kagron 11]]. When the [[Necron]]s invaded the world, Calistus was among the Ultramarines' forces that came to Kagron II's aid. As they fought the [[Xenos]], the [[Chapter]] made contact with a number of [[Adepta Sororitas]], who were defending their ruined basilica. It was ultimately Calistus who convinced them to aid the Ultramarines, after he raised his Flamer and bid the Sororitas to unleash their holy fire upon the Necrons.{{Fn|1}}

