Callisthenes Van Skorvold.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Callisthenes Van Skorvold''' was one of the heads of the [[Van Skorvold Cartel]].{{Fn|1a}}


==Biography==
Callisthenes and his sister, [[Veritas Van Skorvold|Veritas]], inherited ownership of the cartel following the death of their father, [[Diego Van Skorvold|Diego]].{{Fn|1a}}

When the Van Skorvold cartel came under scrutiny from the [[Administratum]], following persistent rumours that the cartel was engaged in illegal [[mutant]] smuggling, the [[Van Skorvold Star Fort|cartel's headquarters]] were raided by the [[Soul Drinkers]].{{Fn|1a}} During the raid, Callisthenes was captured by the [[Space Marines]]{{Fn|1a}} and forced to reveal the location of the [[Soulspear]], a lost relic of the [[Chapter]] that had come into the cartel's possession.{{Fn|1b}}

Callisthenes was detained on board the cartel's star fort, and was still there when the Soul Drinkers were forced to destroy it. He died as the star fort burned up in the planet [[Lakonia|Lakonia's]] atmosphere.{{Fn|1c}}

