Calthyxis.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
[[Image:Calthyxis.jpg|thumb|right|250px|Calthyxis, The Ghost of Primus{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Calthyxis''' , nicknamed '''The Ghost of Primus''', is a [[Bounty Hunter]] from [[House Delaque]] on [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]. Some believe Calthyxis was the first of the [[Nacht-Ghul|Faceless]], created using a mix of esoteric chemicals and dark psychic energy. Many attribute a distinctive pattern of murders, calling cards, and similar crime scenes to this assassin. House Delaque, while never confirming the existence of Calthyxis, benefits from these killings, as the deaths often help further their own schemes.{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Calthyxis was once a loyal assassin for House Delaque, known for their ruthless efficiency and service to the clan’s shadowy goals. After undergoing transformation through the [[Star Chamber]]’s experiments, Calthyxis gained the ability to change appearance, making them even deadlier.{{Fn|1}}

However, during a mission, Calthyxis met their end, but upon returning to Delaque, their face revealed an unexpected property: it had taken on a life of its own. This face, infused with the assassin’s memories, was preserved and passed on. Over time, others have worn Calthyxis' face, becoming exceptional killers, continuing the legacy of the feared assassin.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Necromunda: House of Shadow]], pg. 46

