Cambria.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Cambria''' is an [[Astra Militarum]] [[Lord Marshal]], who took part in the campaign to end the rebellion on [[Sirene Primal]], led by the '''Sirene Monarch'''.{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
During the war's 4th year, however, the [[Inquisitor]] [[Obodiah Roth|Roth]] arrived, seeking to locate the origins of [[psychic]] emanations located on the world. This led Roth to discover that the '''Sirene Monarch''' was a [[Genestealer Cultist]] and whose Cult was responsible for the emanations. These emanations were leading a massive [[Hive Fleet]] to Sirene and Cambria quickly assembled a strike force to attack the Monarch's newly discovered lair. Roth meanwhile led a [[Kill Team Unit|Kill Team]] that was able to kill the Monarch, as the strike force fought the Cult. However the Inquisitor would learn from a surviving Cultists, before it was executed, that it was too late to stop the Hive Fleet. With the world now in serious danger, Roth urged the [[Imperial Navy]] fleet above Sirene, to retreat after evacuating all senior officers and dignitaries from it. Cambria was among them and the fleet escaped shortly before the Hive Fleet arrived and [[Dead World|consumed]] Sirene Primal.{{Fn|1}}

