Camilla Noesis.wikitext:
{{OrdoXenosPortal}}
'''Camilla Noesis''' was an [[Ordo Xenos]] [[Inquisitor]], who arrived unannounced at [[Watch Fortress Erioch]], alongside Inquisitor [[Kaleb (Inquisitor)|Kaleb]], in 715.[[M41]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
The two would offer no explanation of how they had learned of [[Erioch]]'s hidden location in the [[Jericho Reach]]. Instead, they simply said that the time was as it should be and their credentials and ciphers allowed them to enter the [[Watch Fortress]]. Their visit coincided with an opening of an [[Omega Vault]] chamber, which contained a chronograph from the [[Dark Age of Technology]]. It appeared to be meticulously marking a countdown of time, measuring the hours and their divisions with total precision. This reveal then caused Erioch's '''Chamber of Vigilance''' and the Inquisitors to stand in discussion for thirteen days and nights. Once the talks were over, Noesis and Kaleb left the Watch Fortress and the Inquisitors took all records of their discussions with them.{{Fn|1}} 

