'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is the Second [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Golden Sons]] [[Chapter]]. Among his many titles and accomplishments are: '''Keeper of the Wheel, Slayer of Danrane of the Fifteenth Path, Bloodlord of Kathoi''' and '''Exterminator of the Skaal'''.{{Fn|1a}}

He was chosen by his [[Chapter Master]], [[Erden Cleeve]], to lead the Golden Sons strike force sent to aid the [[Blood Angels]] in defending [[Baal]], from an [[Devastation of Baal|invasion]] by [[Hive Fleet Leviathan]].{{Fn|1a}} Though Leviathan was eventually defeated, it is not known if Cantar survived the campaign against the [[Hive Fleet]].{{Fn|1b}}

