'''Carfax''' was a [[Space Marine]] of the [[Deathwatch]], originally hailing from the [[Angels Vermillion]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

Carfax was part of a [[Kill-Team]], led by [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Polino]], that was sent to a [[Desert World]] contested between the [[Imperium]] and the [[Tau Empire]], piloting the kill-team's [[Thunderhawk]]. He was killed by [[Kroot]] snipers while still in the vehicle's cockpit.{{Fn|1}}

