Carmina.wikitext:
{{AdeptaSororitasPortal}}
'''Carmina''' was a [[Canoness]] of the [[Order of the Argent Shroud]]{{Fn|2}} with a reputation as a master tactician.{{Fn|1}}

She commanded Argent Shroud forces in the [[Third War for Armageddon]], where they fought in the [[Fire Wastes]] alongside the [[Space Marines]] of the [[Flesh Tearers]] [[Chapter]]. Over the course of the fighting, she became horrified by the Flesh Tearers' brutality, particularly when they slaughtered many [[Gaius Point Militia|militia]] and [[Imperial citizen]]s at [[Gaius Point]] after [[The Flaw|losing control]] and [[Red Thirst|going]] [[Black Rage|berserk]] fighting against the [[ork]]s.{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}

Carmina has requested a full [[Inquisition|Inquisitorial]] investigation of the Chapter.{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}} For his part, [[Chapter Master]] [[Gabriel Seth]] has directed his Chapter's forces elsewhere in the Wastes, away from other [[Imperial]] forces.{{Fn|1}}

